{"id": "140362", "name": "מציאת משלים למרחב הפתרונות של מטריצה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "collify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([cols:[]],for i:1 thru length(transpose(M)) do(cols: endcons(col(M,i),cols)),cols)"}, {"name": "rowify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([rows:[]],for i:1 thru length(M) do(rows: endcons(row(M,i),rows)),rows)"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "colp", "params": ["v"], "body": "if (matrixp(v)) then is(length(v)=n and length(transpose(v))=1) else false"}, {"name": "collistp", "params": ["lst"], "body": "alltrue(colp,lst)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{{{CT:0}}\\times {{CT:0}}}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:1}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\in M_{{{CT:0}}\\times {{CT:0}}}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>, כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\mathbb{R}^{{CT:0}}=N(A)\\oplus Row(B)\\]</p><p>כלומר, יש למצוא מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> כך שהסכום של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)\\)</span> ומרחב השורות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> (לאחר שחלוף), הוא סכום ישר הנותן את כל המרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{{CT:0}}\\)</span>. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)\\)</span> הוא מרחב הפתרונות לממ\"ל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ax=0\\)</span>, מרחב הפתרונות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>. ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Row(B)\\)</span> הוא מרחב השורות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> כשחושבים עליהם כוקטורי עמודה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 1, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "validInput: is(length(ans1) = n and length(transpose(ans1))=n);\nans: if validInput then ans1 else zeromatrix(n,n); /*avoid errors due to invalid input*/\nansrowsbase: delete(zeromatrix(n,1),collify(transpose(echelon(ans))));\nleqdim: is(length(ansrowsbase) <= rankA);\ngeqdim: is(length(ansrowsbase) >= rankA);\ndirectsum: not dependentvects(append(NA,ansrowsbase));\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "validInput", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> שהזנת אינה מהסדר הנכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "geqdim", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)+Row(B)\\)</span> אינו כל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>. מימד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Row(B)\\)</span> נמוך מדי.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "leqdim", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הסכום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)+Row(B)\\)</span> אינו סכום ישר. מימד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Row(B)\\)</span> גבוה מדי.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "directsum", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הסכום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)+Row(B)\\)</span> אינו סכום ישר: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(N(A)\\cap Row(B)\\neq\\{0\\}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["NA", "coin", "cols", "k", "mat", "n", "rankA"], "nvariants": 50}